Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         docker.io | docker-ce | docker
Recommends: gsettings-desktop-schemas
Description: GTK3 desktop client for managing Docker
 Dodo is a desktop GTK3-powered C++ client that lets you manage Docker
 from the local machine. It provides a graphical interface to view and
 manage containers, images, networks, and volumes.
